{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "floorball-match-2024",
		"name": "FloorballMatch - EventSourced Implementation",
		"description": "Collection for creating floorball matches using EventSourced endpoints\n\n## Overview:\nThis collection demonstrates the complete flow for creating a floorball match:\n1. Setup: Fetch required IDs (seasons, teams, referees, players)\n2. Create single match and test the complete flow\n3. Verify results\n\n## Prerequisites:\n- Backend API running on localhost:8080\n- At least one season exists in database\n- At least two teams exist with players\n- At least one referee exists\n\n## Flow:\n1. **Setup**: Fetch and store all required IDs\n2. **Single Match Demo**: Create → Add Official → Start → Events → Complete\n3. **Queries**: Verify the match was created correctly\n\n## Endpoints Used (EventSourced):\n- POST /FloorballMatchEvent/match (create)\n- POST /FloorballMatchEvent/match/{id}/official (add official)\n- POST /FloorballMatchEvent/match/{id}/start (start)\n- POST /FloorballMatchEvent/goal (record goals)\n- POST /FloorballMatchEvent/match/{id}/complete (complete)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "season_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
